{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/kitakami_center.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/kitakami_center.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_01_01",
      "hash64": "A013CEC78ED796CE",
      "text": "欢迎来到北上中心！\\n庆典马上就要开始咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_08_01",
      "hash64": "ACF80B1365DFC5FB",
      "text": "卡比兽啊，它在宝可梦中的\\n分类是瞌睡宝可梦！\\r\\n……这还真是一目了然呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "kitakami_center_before_12_01",
      "hash64": "D994668B07B6F842",
      "text": "我们准备了好玩的游戏哦。\\n掩面祭开始后，就过来看看吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_01",
      "hash64": "E8BC97C1C2E20735",
      "text": "北上中心正在举办掩面祭！\\n好孩子，坏孩子，都来玩吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_02",
      "hash64": "E8BC94C1C2E2021C",
      "text": "有个穿着像是宝伴布偶装的\\n家伙冲上了楼梯！\\r\\n里面的人真是辛苦啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_01_03",
      "hash64": "E8BC95C1C2E203CF",
      "text": "我看到的那个\\n竟然是货真价实的宝伴啊！\\r\\n早知道我就拍下视频了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_09_01",
      "hash64": "C853E807376B910D",
      "text": "我想买面具，\\n但摆摊的人却不在啊。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_09_02",
      "hash64": "C853E507376B8BF4",
      "text": "摆摊的人好像回来了，\\n现在的话应该能买到面具了吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_10_01",
      "hash64": "012A6BEF121A6243",
      "text": "有好多好多面具！\\n到底要选哪个呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_10_02",
      "hash64": "012A6CEF121A63F6",
      "text": "如果我戴上皮卡丘的面具，\\n那心情也会变得皮！皮卡丘！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_16_01",
      "hash64": "2A6CB7DEA1A36565",
      "text": "用团扇扇风很凉快！\\n但只要手一动，汗就会冒个不停！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_01",
      "hash64": "DA91105C4FABBB26",
      "text": "宝伴的面具\\n在今年也还是很受欢迎啊！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_02",
      "hash64": "DA910F5C4FABB973",
      "text": "宝伴还活着！？真的假的！？\\n那要不要戴上面具去跟它们结交一下呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_20_03",
      "hash64": "DA910E5C4FABB7C0",
      "text": "吉雉鸡本尊\\n并没有那么粉红啊～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_01",
      "hash64": "084B1C62B28768BB",
      "text": "愿增猿的面具！\\n蓝色的，好帅啊～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_02",
      "hash64": "084B1D62B2876A6E",
      "text": "咦？\\n宝伴竟然还真的存在吗！？\\r\\n我还以为只是捏造出来的呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_21_03",
      "hash64": "084B1E62B2876C21",
      "text": "现实中的愿增猿，面色是铁青的！\\n它是不是哪里不舒服呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_01",
      "hash64": "5EB0E46A4DF125C4",
      "text": "一戴上面具，\\n我就感觉自己像变了一个人！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_02",
      "hash64": "5EB0E76A4DF12ADD",
      "text": "我一直以为鬼的历史\\n是编出来让小孩子\\r\\n乖乖听话用的！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_22_03",
      "hash64": "5EB0E66A4DF1292A",
      "text": "够赞狗原来是坏蛋吗！？\\n那它赞在哪里啊！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_25_01",
      "hash64": "2D0BD44094B817DF",
      "text": "历史的介绍牌上\\n画着的那个人……\\r\\n是宝伴们的训练家吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_31_01",
      "hash64": "A06184872CB35D74",
      "text": "这里在办打鬼祭哦！\\n快来玩玩看，争取豪华奖品吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "kitakami_center_after_55_01",
      "hash64": "C4F2B040AC5B9C36",
      "text": "打鬼祭是一种\\n骑着宝可梦玩的游戏！\\c\\n没有宝可梦的人也不用担心！\\n惊角鹿已经做好准备咯！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
